  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">new REC Serbia Strenghtening the CSOs - Monitoring for new REC Serbia Strenghtening CSOs</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">nytt REC Serbien St&#xe4;rkande av milj&#xf6; NGOs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Organisation REC Serbia has applied to Sida for funding of approximatelly 2 million Euros (approximatelly 19 million SEK) to carry out the &quot;Environmental Civil Society Support Programme for Serbia
2015 &#x2013; 2018 CSOnnect&quot;. The intervention aims at to empower civil society organizations to effectively, actively and in a gender-sensitive manner participate in environmental policy development and decision-making, take active part in Serbia&apos;s EU process, and monitor and evaluate environmental project implementation on local, regional and national level.

The intervention&#x2019;s total budget is approximatelly 19 million SEK (2 million Euros). Approximately 7,5 million SEK (800 000 Euros - 2 rounds x 10 grants, core support) of the intervention budget will be forwarded from organisation REC Serbia to the Serbian environmental CSOs.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Organisation REC Serbien har till Sida ans&#xf6;kt om finansiering av ca. 2 miljoner euro ( 19 miljoner kronor ) f&#xf6;r att utf&#xf6;ra &quot;Environmental Civil Society Support Programme for Serbia 2015 &#x2013; 2018 CSOnnect&quot;. Insatsen syftar till att ge det civila samh&#xe4;llets organisationer m&#xf6;jlighet att effektivt , aktivt och p&#xe5; ett genusmedvetet s&#xe4;tt delta i utvecklingen av milj&#xf6;politiken och beslutsfattandet , ta aktiv del i Serbiens EU-processen och &#xf6;vervaka och utv&#xe4;rdera milj&#xf6;projekt genomf&#xf6;rande p&#xe5; lokal, regional och nationell niv&#xe5; .

Programmetss totala budget &#xe4;r 19 miljoner kronor ( ca. 2 miljoner euro ) . Cirka 7,5 miljoner kronor ( 800 000 euro - 2 omg&#xe5;ngar x 10 bidrag , core st&#xf6;d) av programmets budget kommer att vidarebefordras fr&#xe5;n organisation REC Serbien till serbiska milj&#xf6;civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationer.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal is to empower civil society organizations to effectively, actively and in a gender-sensitive manner to participate in environmental policy development and decision-making, take active part in Serbia&apos;s EU process, and monitor and evaluate environmental project implementation on local, regional and national level.</narrative>
  </description>
